      "content": "hey... is it weird that i saw the same guy twice today? like literally the same person, same jacket, same coffee cup, walking past me on 5th and then again 2 mins later on 8th even though he was walking towards me the first time. gave me the worst feeling. like something just... lagged. u ever see stuff like that?",
